    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1826">

                <pb facs="1193" n="1077" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg1077"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 816.001/6.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">San Salvador</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-08-29">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 29, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>This morning at nine o’clock in the National Palace President Meléndez turned
                    over the Executive power to the First Designate, Dr. Alfonso Quiñónez M.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tennant</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
